# TNA seed-stability study — sweeps seeds 42..45 in parallel branches.
# Each branch independently loads, embeds, clusters, aligns, finds dispersion, saves.
# This was previously a bash for-loop calling the same Python script 4 times.

seed 42

sweep seed from 42 to 45 do
    load tmp/bombe_tna.ndjson take 500 records balanced by archive label field is archive
    embed text into 128 dimensions using tf-idf
    cluster for 16 rounds max 24 modules energy = corpus mean
    align modules using 50 nearest records fine label field is primary_category
    find dispersion of each label
    save to data/validation/tna_ocean_seed_${seed}.json
end
